in the morning.

134
00:09:53.966 --> 00:09:55.965
Okay.

135
00:09:55.966 --> 00:09:57.400
I love you.

136
00:10:09.932 --> 00:10:11.198
Shit!

137
00:10:11.199 --> 00:10:12.965
