242
00:17:41.199 --> 00:17:43.298
I'm not 12.

243
00:17:43.299 --> 00:17:46.531
My roof, my rules.
Sit.

244
00:17:46.532 --> 00:17:48.931
You know, I'm not gonna
be here much longer.

245
